          <div class="logo">New Super <span>Store</span></div>
          <p>Your trusted neighbourhood departmental store in GK3, Greater Kailash III, serving families since the early 1980s.</p>
          <div class="payment-icons">
            <span class="pay-chip">💰 Cash</span>
            <span class="pay-chip">📲 Paytm</span>
            <span class="pay-chip">🔷 UPI</span>
            <span class="pay-chip">💳 Cards</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h5>Quick Links</h5>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
