      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>© 2024 New Super Store, GK3. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>Made with ❤️ for the GK3 Community</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
